# Java/Spring Boot project stack
- Use Java 21 and Spring Boot 3.4.13
- Project build using Maven
- Use standard Spring Boot layered architecture (controller/service/repository)
- Keep files small and cohesive
- Follow consistent naming conventions: CamelCase for classes, lowerCamelCase for variables